“Trade secret” means information or computer software, including a formula, pattern, compilation, program, device, method, technique, or process, that;
(a) derives independent economic value, actual or potential, from not being generally known to, and not being readily ascertainable by proper means by, other persons who can obtain economic value from it disclosure or use; and
(b) is the subject of efforts that are reasonable under the circumstances to maintain it secrecy.

